1.14.3 Release notes (2026-10-26)
================================

Improvements to the 'RingPublishingTracking' module.

### Changes

* Added 'reportContentClick(selectedElementName:clickContext:publicationUrl:contentId:)'
    - reports content click event with additional click context (e.g. section code), sent as 'VC' parameter
* Added 'smartShorts' to 'AureusDeboostingStrategy' (sent as 'smartshorts')
